**Verdict:** the main argument passes the five-year test. It rests on things he said between 2023 and 2026, not on the latest events, and almost every fact that can change has a date on it. Sombr still qualifies as an open case: he's 21, his first hit charted in April 2025, and research opened 38 sources. The title, description and FAQs all say "leading read" or "held loosely", so nothing overclaims.

**Two major findings (the editor must resolve these before release):**
